  "changed_since_previous": "The accounting approach is unchanged; updates include refined locking annotations, cache invalidation handling when parent transactions are inserted, and release notes documentation.",
  "card": "Updates wallet history accounting in gettransaction, listtransactions, and listsinceblock for mixed-input transactions such as CoinJoins and Payjoins. Currently, the wallet assumes all inputs are wallet-owned, calculating incorrect or negative fees and fabricating recipient entries for non-wallet outputs. Addressing issue #14136 without relying on lost transaction intent metadata, the wallet now retains normal attribution only when foreign inputs have verified zero value (like anchors); otherwise, it reports an unattributed aggregate debit send, omits foreign outputs and fees, and exposes involves_mixed_inputs, wallet_debit, and wallet_credit fields.",
